      <activity id="f5bc6360-c00e-5161-93d0-d885d00b6932" activityNameId="34797089-7728-5a64-be82-ec20f1aea8fa" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="1">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, low pressure, at consumer</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methane, 96 vol-%, from biogas, low pressure, at consumer
Total network losses are based on published data, repartition of losses on high and low pressure network on calculations with data for other countries.;
Synonyms: Kompogas, Naturgas; 
UUID: 543d0375-0a21-3a93-b974-7cf4b3ce0013
This dataset describes the energy requirement and the emissions of the low pressure distribution network in Switzerland.
Location: Energy requirements is based on environmental report of Italian company. Total leakages are specific for CH, HD-leakages are calculated out of the total with German data.
Technology: The quantity of gas delivered in the low pressure network is estimated. Households and half of commercial and of others are assumed to be connected to the low pressure network
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 93 PJ natural gas at 39 MJ/m3 in low pressure network
Sampling: statistics 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_543d0375-0a21-3a93-b974-7cf4b3ce0013.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
